<SoilDataTemplate>
  <SoilType href="\\Mac\Home\Documents\Projects\Howleaky\Project data\HL projects\Wallumbilla\Soil\Brown sodosol.soil" text="Wallumbilla 2026" Description="Brown clay" Comments="Nov 2026 (19 Nov): soil water limits revised by David from 17 years of gravimetric sampling; profile now 5 layers to 1200 mm, PAWC 166 mm (was 6 layers to 1500 mm, 170 mm). Bottom drainage 0.14 mm/day now on layer 5.amp; Cona 7.86 -> 6.08 and CN 83.5 -> 80.5 refitted (runoff P:O = 1, minimum PAW RMSE) with the Wallumbilla crop files.&#xA;Nov 2026 (16 Nov): RunoffCurveNumber is now the bare-soil CN at average wetness (CNReferenceWetness 0.25), converted on reading to the internal CN2 used by the uncapped AMC. Runoff unchanged.&#xA;Nov 2026 (15 Nov): kl removed; U set to 0; no-stress PAW fraction 0.75 in all vege files; Cona and CN2 refitted per site (runoff P:O = 1, minimum PAW RMSE), input-file mode from the revised vege files with no soil water resets; K rescaled for soil movement P:O = 1. Engine fix: days since wetting reset from the stage II total after rain (needed for U = 0).&#xA;Nov 2026: Watbal2026 joint three-site calibration (Greenmount, Greenwood, Wallumbilla) on cumulative P:O, run from revised vege files with no soil water resets. Shared: CN reduction at full cover 14.8, zero-till CN2 offset +5.4, SedCoverCoef 0.057, AMC howleaky, seasonal sediment factor off. Site: CN2, K, Cona, U, bottom drainage. See calibration/joint_2026 in the Southern Queensland small catchment data repository.&#xA;Brown Soodosol  Reference soil description - cropped catchment Wallumbilla catchment study &#xA;Best bet PAW description based on new LL and density from base file (.xls)&#xA;CN  of 85 and CN cover response of 10 best good fit&#xA;K factor 0.4 for the site, &#xA;Delivery ratio  0.4 - larger catchment, higher channel transport resulting in higher proportion being fines&#xA;Freebairn et al 2011, Aust. J Soil Research DMF  24/2/2018, 15/1/2021&#xA;Oct 2026: Watbal2026 calibration with Wheat fallow slower roots vege, pooled tilled + min-till Wallumbilla 1983-1999, runoff and sediment P:O = 1 (AMC howleaky, bottom drain, kl, CN2, CN cover reduction, Cona, U, K)&#xA;">
